#NEXUS

[ han2015a_fig11: Ghost-lineage summary of early ceratopsians, vertical, root at the bottom. Psittacosaurus and Neoceratopsia are collapsed clades drawn as hatched triangles and encoded as tips. Replacement case: drawn with seed 20261115 from the vertical time-axis stratum after morschhauser2018a_fig13 was skipped. 6 tips, fully resolved. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=6;
    TAXLABELS
        Psittacosaurus
        Yinlong
        Hualianceratops
        Chaoyangsaurus
        Xuanhuaceratops
        Neoceratopsia
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE han2015a_fig11 = [&R] ((Psittacosaurus,((Yinlong,Hualianceratops),(Chaoyangsaurus,Xuanhuaceratops))),Neoceratopsia);
END;
